{"product":{"id":9692815687986,"title":"Decaf","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eHotly contested as the best decaf people can find. We can't take credit for the exceptional quality of the green coffee but our air roasting definitely takes this to new heights. Leaving people wondering if it is decaf.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eOrigin: Multiple origins\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eProcess method: Swiss Water\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eVarietal: multiple varietals\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eTasting notes: Chocolate, cacao, good body and balance\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eBrew: Espresso, French press, Stovetop\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eSwiss water method only uses water, temperature and time to gently remove the caffeine, while preserving all the coffee’s original characteristics. Combined with our one of a kind air roasting, it’s an amazing combo.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Hark Coffee","product_type":"","created_at":"2024-11-08T18:21:06+10:30","handle":"decaf-coffee","updated_at":"2026-08-31T16:47:39+09:30","published_at":"2024-11-08T18:21:06+10:30","template_suffix":"decaf","published_scope":"global","tags":"blend, build-box, coffee, espresso, french press, medium dark, plunger, stove top","variants":[{"id":49856931594546,"product_id":9692815687986,"title":"400g \/ Whole Beans","price":"40.00","sku":"","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":null,"option1":"400g","option2":"Whole Beans","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-03-21T09:54:40+10:30","updated_at":"2026-08-31T16:47:39+09:30","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"AUD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":49856931627314,"product_id":9692815687986,"title":"